    "travelTips": [
      "The shape of this trip is the point: Bangalore to Madikeri in one go is 6–7 hours of driving, so both directions break at Mysore.",
      "Book the Dubare interaction slot weeks ahead — walk-in buys the riverside walk, not the elephants.",
      "Mysore Palace ticket includes the audio guide; the light-and-sound show is a separate evening ticket.",
      "Carry cash for Devaraja Market and small temples; card is unreliable outside Mysore.",
      "Fuel up at Kushalnagar before the Bylakuppe run — the pump density drops fast west of the town."
