    "warningsAndAssumptions": [
      "Entry fees verified Sep 2026 against Karnataka Tourism, Coorg Tourism, the Mysore Palace office and Ranganathittu's own ticketing site.",
      "Mysore Palace adult entry was ₹50 at the palace's Dec-2025 announcement; older guidebooks still print ₹70 and special-event days differ. Verify at the gate.",
      "Dubare basic camp entry is ₹100/person; the Jungle Lodges elephant-interaction package (₹1,400+) is separate and pre-booked only.",
      "Fuel is priced at ₹105/L for ~600 km in a 14 km/L car; Karnataka pump prices run ₹94–110 depending on district.",
      "Oct 2 is a long weekend in 2026 — Mysore and Madikeri both fill by Friday night; the 6 AM start is not optional.",
